---
description: Supabase and database rules
globs: supabase/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow docs/DATABASE.md and AGENTS.md.
- All schema changes must be committed as SQL migrations.
- Enable RLS for tables exposed to client access.
- Add policies for anon, authenticated customer, and admin as appropriate.
- Never allow users to grant themselves admin privileges.
- Remember service_role bypasses RLS; backend authorization remains mandatory.
- Preserve order and payment snapshots.
- Do not use floating-point types for money.
- Include indexes and constraints where justified.
